    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a management simulation game featuring Chinese ancient-style architectural layouts. Players own an establishment similar to an inn or shop, with areas such as main halls and sales departments. Within this venue, players can engage in operational management.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The top of the screen displays the quantities of gold coins and diamonds. Players can manage these resources for shop operations, building upgrades, and other purposes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Building and Area Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are functional building areas such as &quot;Main Hall&quot; and &quot;General Goods Stall&quot;. Players need to construct, upgrade, and furnish these areas to enhance the venue's operational efficiency and revenue.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Task System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A &quot;Tasks&quot; button located at the bottom allows players to obtain rewards by completing missions, thereby advancing the game's progression.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Construction Function</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also includes a construction feature, enabling players to build new structures or facilities within the scene to expand their business scale.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Exploration Function</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exploration function may allow players to leave the venue for activities such as exploration, trading, and accepting external missions. An &quot;Achievements&quot; button lets players view their in-game accomplishments.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a management simulation game featuring Chinese ancient-style architectural layouts. Players own an establishment similar to an inn or shop, with areas such as main halls and sales departments. Within this venue, players can engage in operational management.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The top of the screen displays the quantities of gold coins and diamonds. Players can manage these resources for shop operations, building upgrades, and other purposes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Building and Area Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are functional building areas such as &quot;Main Hall&quot; and &quot;General Goods Stall&quot;. Players need to construct, upgrade, and furnish these areas to enhance the venue's operational efficiency and revenue.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Task System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A &quot;Tasks&quot; button located at the bottom allows players to obtain rewards by completing missions, thereby advancing the game's progression.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Construction Function</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also includes a construction feature, enabling players to build new structures or facilities within the scene to expand their business scale.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Exploration Function</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exploration function may allow players to leave the venue for activities such as exploration, trading, and accepting external missions. An &quot;Achievements&quot; button lets players view their in-game accomplishments.</p>",
    "short_description": "This is a business - simulation game. The in - game graphics feature a layout of Chinese - style ancient architecture. Players own a place similar to an inn or a shop. The game offers functions such as quests, construction, crafting, and farming, allowing players to experience a rich rural life.",
